{"text":"魏靈藏。釋迦像。薛法紹。夫靈跡誕遘，必表光大之跡；玄功既敷，亦標希世之作。自雙林改照，大千懷綴暎之悲；慧日潛暉，唅生銜道慕之痛。是以應真悼三乘之靡憑，遂騰空以刊像。爰暨下代，茲容厥作。鉅鏕魏靈藏、河東薛法紹二人等，求豪光東照之資，闕兜率翅頭之益，敢輒罄家財造石像一區，凡及眾形，罔不備列。願乾祚興延，萬方朝貫。願藏等挺三槐於孤峰，秀九棘於華苑。芳實再繁，荊條獨茂；合門榮葩，福流並葉。命終之後，飛逢千聖，神颺六通，智周三達。曠世所生元身眷屬，捨百鄣則鵬擊龍花，悟無生則鳳昇道樹。五道群生，咸同斯慶。陸渾縣功曹魏靈藏。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"魏靈藏","refId":null,"text":"魏靈藏","start":0,"end":3},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":4,"end":6},{"name":"PersonName","term":"薛法紹","refId":null,"text":"薛法紹","start":8,"end":11},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"娑羅雙樹","refId":null,"text":"雙林","start":38,"end":40},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"慧日","refId":null,"text":"慧日","start":51,"end":53},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"阿羅漢","refId":null,"text":"應真","start":66,"end":68},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三乘","refId":null,"text":"三乘","start":69,"end":71},{"name":"PersonName","term":"魏靈藏","refId":null,"text":"魏靈藏","start":94,"end":97},{"name":"PersonName","term":"薛法紹","refId":null,"text":"薛法紹","start":100,"end":103},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"白毫相","refId":null,"text":"豪光","start":108,"end":110},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"兜率","refId":null,"text":"兜率","start":116,"end":118},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"翅頭末城","refId":null,"text":"翅頭","start":118,"end":120},{"name":"Udef_Cultural_Term","term":"三槐","refId":null,"text":"三槐","start":159,"end":161},{"name":"Udef_Cultural_Term","term":"九棘","refId":null,"text":"九棘","start":166,"end":168},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"六通","refId":null,"text":"六通","start":204,"end":206},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三達","refId":null,"text":"三達","start":209,"end":211},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無量劫","refId":null,"text":"曠世","start":212,"end":214},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"龍花","start":227,"end":229},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"無生法忍","refId":null,"text":"無生","start":231,"end":233},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"菩提樹","refId":null,"text":"道樹","